{"id":"000VH3","title":"Fog of War #45","author":"Sudonym","solvedCount":94,"difficulty":1,"rating":"85 %","firstSeen":"2026-10-17T17:33:19+00:00","posted":"am 13. Oktober 2026, 09:24 Uhr","rules":"Fog of war sudoku. Mixed rules. Link to puzzle.\nsudoku.\nThere is a video solution and more puzzles on youtube channel \"sudoku spot\"\nvideo solution.\n\nRules:\nNormal sudoku rules apply.\nFog opens differently as correct particular numbers are placed.\nCells of the same colour are the same value.\nCages are Psycho look-and-say cages. (see video on these if confused) Rules are as follows.\nNumbers in the top corner of the cages are look-and-say values telling how many of these numbers are in the pointed cells. For e.g. 38 ( 3 8's) would mean 3 of the cells in the cage point to an 8.\nNumbers in cages point to a 3x3 box number....so a number 5 would point to box number 5, number 8 points to box number 8.\nGo to that box number and find the same position as the number in the cage. This is where the look-and-say numbers must be.\nvideo explanation of psycho look-and-say cages.","solutionCode":"Row 9","tags":["Sudoku"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/0n9e8m657r","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/0n9e8m657r","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":7,"hasSolution":true,"features":["underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-17T17:33:19+00:00"}